{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DAN","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"但以理書","commonName":"但以理書","title":"但以理書","order":27,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"e737d04e007b6566079701bc36a844090baf5105e132b21627aa44037893bbaa","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DAN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DAN/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":355},"chapter":{"number":12,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["末日"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「那時，守護你同胞的天使長米迦勒必挺身而出。將有一段災難時期，是開國以來從未有過的。那時，你同胞中凡名字記在冊子上的，必得拯救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["許多長眠地下的人必醒過來，有些得到永生，有些蒙受羞辱，永遠被憎惡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["智者必發出光輝，如耀眼的穹蒼；引導多人歸向公義的人必如閃亮的星辰，直到永永遠遠。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["但以理啊，這些話要保密，要把這書封起來，直到末了。許多人必四處探究，因而知識必增多。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我但以理觀看，看見另有兩個人分別站在河的兩岸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["其中一人問身穿細麻衣、站在河水之上的人：「這奇異的事何時才應驗呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["我聽見身穿細麻衣、站在河水之上的人向天舉起雙手，憑永活者起誓說：「再過三年半，等摧毀聖民的權勢結束時，這一切事都要成就。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我聽見這話，卻不明白，就問他：「我主啊，這些事的結局會怎樣呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他說：「但以理啊，你走吧，因為這些事要保密，要被封起來，一直到末了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["許多人必被淨化、洗滌、煉淨。但惡人必依舊作惡，他們無人明白，只有智者能明白。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["從廢除日常獻的祭、設立帶來毀滅的可憎之物算起，必經過一千二百九十天。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["能等候一千三百三十五天的人有福了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你要堅持到底。你必得到安息，到了末後的日子，你必起來承受你的產業。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DAN/12.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/DAN/11.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}